<title>BELGIUM: Belgium sells further 9.235 bln bfr of OLOs.</title>
<headline>Belgium sells further 9.235 bln bfr of OLOs.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury gave the following details of linear bond (OLO) sales volume at its non-competitive OLO auction - (in billions of Belgian francs)</p>
<p>    Bond line		1998	2001     2006     Grand total</p>
<p>    Competitive auction   3.500     8.650    5.090    17.240</p>
<p>    Non-comp.   auction   2.835     3.845    2.555     9.235</p>
<p>    Total							   26.475</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
